NAME: GT with an explicit AB modifier
DESCRIPTION: (GT AB x y) compares x's A-field with y's B-field; GT is emitted as SLT y, x, so the modifier swaps to BA; see behtests/gt_explicit_modifier.beh
SRC:
(seq
  (if (GT AB xc yc) (MOV 7 flag))
  (JMP 0)
  (label xc) (DAT 5 0)
  (label yc) (DAT 9 1)
  (label flag) (DAT 0 0))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b

  SLT.BA $yc    , $xc    
  JMP    $_IF3  , #0     
  MOV.AB #7     , $flag  
_IF3  
  JMP    #0     , #0     
xc    
  DAT    #5     , #0     
yc    
  DAT    #9     , #1     
flag  
  DAT    #0     , #0     
  DAT    $0     , $0     